# 4MATION's Dragon World loader boots from 480Z_4MATION_Dragon_World_1985_both-sector-08.IMD: it reads cylinder 2 sector 08 with 0E until it meets
# the copy its check wants (two sectors 08 on the track, found by where the disc is: docs/protocol.md,
# "Copy-protected discs"), then verifies cylinder 3 with 0D.
drive A 480Z_4MATION_Dragon_World_1985_both-sector-08.IMD
seconds 60
type 2.0 B
